CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786605488
OL,3,CAlmost 500 children injured in e-
OL,4,Cscooter incidents since 2019, study
OL,5,Cfinds
OL,7,FAlmost 500 children in England have
OL,8,Fbeen hurt by e-scooters since 2019,
OL,9,Fnew analysis suggests.
OL,11,FThe average age of youngsters injured
OL,12,Fwas 12, with fewer than 2% wearing
OL,13,Fhelmets at the time of the incidents.
OL,15,FThere is an urgent need for clearer
OL,16,Fpublic health messaging and a review
OL,17,Fof government legislation to prevent
OL,18,Ffurther injuries and deaths,
OL,19,Fresearchers said.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/8
