PN,36402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786605488
OL,3,CAlmost 500 children injured in e-
OL,4,Cscooter incidents since 2019, study
OL,5,Cfinds
OL,7,FThey highlighted that 59 deaths have
OL,8,Fbeen reported in the UK involving e-
OL,9,Fscooters, 10 of which were people
OL,10,Funder the age of 18.
OL,12,FIt is illegal to use privately owned e-
OL,13,Fscooters in public, although they are
OL,14,Favailable to rent as part of
OL,15,FGovernment pilots in certain cities.
OL,17,FThe study examined data from Liverpool
OL,18,Fand Manchester, which have rental
OL,19,Fprogrammes, and Sheffield, which does
OL,20,Fnot.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
