PN,36405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786605488
OL,3,CAlmost 500 children injured in e-
OL,4,Cscooter incidents since 2019, study
OL,5,Cfinds
OL,7,FWriting in the Emergency Medicine
OL,8,FJournal, researchers said: "E-scooter
OL,9,Frelated injuries are rising.
OL,11,F"Limb, head and facial injuries were
OL,12,Fmost common, with head injuries being
OL,13,Fmost severe, this has serious life-
OL,14,Fchanging implications for families and
OL,15,Fsignificant impact on healthcare
OL,16,Fresources.
OL,26,@pD@\OUsD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/8
