PN,36406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786605488
OL,3,CAlmost 500 children injured in e-
OL,4,Cscooter incidents since 2019, study
OL,5,Cfinds
OL,7,F"There is a need for greater public
OL,8,Fawareness, clear public health
OL,9,Fmessaging and review of government
OL,10,Flegislation to prevent further
OL,11,Finjuries and deaths."
OL,13,FJust 1.8% of youngsters injured in e-
OL,14,Fscooter incidents were wearing a
OL,15,Fhelmet, according to the analysis.
OL,17,FMore than half of cases happened on
OL,18,Fpublic land such as roads, and on
OL,19,Ffootpaths or in parks.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/8
