FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786605488
OL,3,CAlmost 500 children injured in e-
OL,4,Cscooter incidents since 2019, study
OL,5,Cfinds
OL,7,FResearchers added: "Retailers should
OL,8,Fhave a responsibility to pass on the
OL,9,Flegal regulations to their customers
OL,10,Fas well as UK regulations to ensure
OL,11,Fsafety in the design of private e-
OL,12,Fscooters."
OL,14,FA Department for Transport
OL,15,Fspokesperson said: "These are
OL,16,Fconcerning findings, and our thoughts
OL,17,Fare with anyone who has been injured
OL,18,Fon our roads.
OL,26,@oD@TOUtD@JO]wD@TOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/8
