FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786605488
OL,3,CAlmost 500 children injured in e-
OL,4,Cscooter incidents since 2019, study
OL,5,Cfinds
OL,7,F"It is illegal for private e-scooters
OL,8,Fto be used on roads, pavements or in
OL,9,Fother public spaces, including by
OL,10,Funder 16s, and we're bringing forward
OL,11,Fnew laws to make their use safe and
OL,12,Flegal, including consulting on
OL,13,Frequirements like helmets."
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@[O]
